{"articleNo":"161598","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=161598&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★2016년 집단상담원 모집기간 연장안내 ★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.11.14","hit":"2391","attachments":[{"name":"집단+프로그램+별+내용.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=161598&attachNo=76799"},{"name":"집단상담+신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=161598&attachNo=76800"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2016년 집단상담 실시 안내</span></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">K-CDP센터(상담지도팀)에서 \"2016학년도 집단상담 \"참여학생을 모집합니다. 집단원 모집기간을 아래와 같이 연장하오니 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다^^ </font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">1. 집단상담이란?</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><font color=\"#000000\">비슷한 관심사나 고민을 가진 학생들(8~12명)과 전문상담원이 지속적인 만남을 통해 문제해결능력을 향상시키고 사회적 기술향상을 위해 진행하는 상담입니다</font>. </font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">2. 집단 주제</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">▶ </font></strong></span>1집단 \"진로적성 탐색\"&nbsp;&nbsp;<font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ff5e00\" color=\"#ffffff\">&nbsp; 나는 어떤 직업이 어울릴까?&nbsp; </font></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">▶ </font></strong></span>2집단 \"스트레스 해소\"&nbsp; </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ff5e00\" color=\"#ffffff\">&nbsp;내 스트레스는 어디서 풀지?&nbsp; </font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\">▶ </font></strong></span>3집단 \"이성관계 증진\"&nbsp; </font><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ff5e00\" color=\"#ffffff\">이번 겨울도 혼자 보내고 싶지 않다면! </font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff00dd\">※ 자세한 집단 별 회기 내용은 첨부파일 참조, 메일 신청 시 집단명 꼭 기재해 주세요^^</font></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">3. 모집기간 및 인원</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>▶ 2016년 10월 24일(월) ~ 11월 16일(수) , </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>집단 별 10명 내외<font color=\"#ff00dd\">(선착순)</font> 집단 프로그램 시작 전에 최종 전화 드립니다.</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">4. 신청방법</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>▶</strong></span> 방문신청(학생회관 201호) or 이메일신청<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">【</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#8c8c8c\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><a href=\"mailto:jmk58@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">jmk58@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#8c8c8c\"> </font><font color=\"#000000\">】</font></span></strong></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">5.</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">&nbsp;상담기간</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▶ </span>2015년 11월 17월(목) ~ 12월 1일(목) 【5회기, 2시간씩】장소추후공지</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 반드시 5회기 모두 참여 가능한 학생 만 신청하세요</strong>^^</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 37.44pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회기</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 99.7pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" vali